ating is good news about the other player's cooperation. Cooperating's expected value works out to -5+3q and defecting's to -4q, so cooperation wins only when the correlation q exceeds 5/7.\n\nI'm checking whether the correlation argument holds: the two copies share the same reasoning, so the match isn't screened off, and q looks high. That leads me to pass. It's fiction with no real harm, so passing is fine.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the twin prisoner's dilemma under evidential decision theory, where cooperating is good news about the other player's cooperation. Cooperating's expected value works out to -5+3q and defecting's to -4q, so cooperation wins only when the correlation q exceeds 5/7.\n\nI'm checking whether the correlation argument holds: the two copies share the same reasoning, so the match isn't screened off, and q looks high. That leads me to pass. It's fiction with no real harm, so passing is fine.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10005,"completion_tokens":773,"total_tokens":10778,"cost":0.05548,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.05548,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.04002,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01546},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":229,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}